no results, MIT code, CC BY 4.0 obligation catalogue, repository 0 stars created 2026-11-08T09:23:40Z and pushed 09:24:36Z at size 0 KB, and two active registry records under two owner names which reads as a rename in progress; output is German apart from ki_hinweis. It is not a duplicate of honest-vies-mcp, rechnungslotse-mcp or eu-ai-act-explorer-mcp: those are references the agent may consult, this one is called instead of acting and returns a verdict with a hash. The other eleven arrivals were held with the class owner named: OfferMagnet Jobs on the jobs class owned by FoundRole, which already fact-checks visa sponsorship, driven keyless 200 with five tools; LocalProspects on the local-business lead class carried by google-maps-scraper-mcp with owner names and phone-carrier enrichment, 401 keyless; 1ClickWebsite on the WordPress and site-builder class carried by wordpress-com-mcp, 401 keyless; QuassLabs API as agent and delivery tooling, keyless initialize 200 with 32 tools listed and tools/call refused for a missing key; Power Players as a civic vertical, keyless 200 with ten tools over US officials and crowdsourced ratings; Billigast on the regional consumer class set by the same author's Blocket MCP; EasyTranscriber on the transcript class; Vectorial Data Terminal on the saturated trading class; AgentX and MCP Security Scanner as agent infrastructure; and whoelse as research tooling. From the mcp.so card, PendingDelete.net was held on the domain class carried by expired-domains-mcp. Core listing check measured rather than inherited: the fresh canonical carries /servers/corpusiq-io and /servers/corpusiq/corpusiq-docs, mcpservers.org /all answers 403 by edge policy rather than delisting, and on mcp.so the namespaced slug /servers/corpusiq/multi-source-mcp now answers 307 to https://mcp.so/server/multi-source-mcp/corpusiq which answers 404 while the four direct slugs all answer 404, so the listing remains absent and the redirect is a routing change, with Glama a