he fallback, and every outward write held for approval in the console with a call_id. Held with the class owner named: supercatch-com-ai, which answered keylessly with 82 tools and the cleanest approval design of the window, on the collectible pricing class where the PokeInvest ruling stands with the reversal test recorded; oort, memscope-ai, ragionex and constellate on memory; saifuban as an agent spend guard; mishmar as trading risk control; screenata on the compliance programme class; voxisim on phone numbers; anyhook on developer infrastructure; aurelix and apinoa on the Apify-actor hold; findbroadband, patternswizard, tokenmark, perigee, microlaunch, agent-company, flisk, specialneeds, liquid-composer, newsjack and solvehub outside operator scope; cloro-dev as a re-listing of the August 12 cloro entry; and from the queue hiveref on hiring verification, nod as a local approval primitive, otdeck and kafdesk as desktop-bundled local servers, annsa, boterly, gameye, memorybrain, yandex-tracker-mcp-lite, virtnumber, fwrd-sms, agent-vscreen, favicondl, qsignals, saascustomdomains, clockintoday and pokeitem. Core listing check measured rather than inherited: the fresh canonical carries /servers/corpusiq-io and /servers/corpusiq/corpusiq-docs, mcpservers.org /all answered 403 by edge policy rather than delisting, all four direct mcp.so slugs answered 404 so that listing remains absent, and both Glama routes answered 301 to their query pages, the routing change recorded at midday rather than a delisting. Counts: canonical 20,204 against 20,018 with 186 additions and 0 removals from 63,644 raw loc entries across thirteen maps, feed 159 and 160 cards with two above the midday stamp and an eighteen-card scheduled bulk publish, 24 queue numbers all arrivals, 26 candidates read beyond the sitemap wave, six servers catalogued and six guides, guide tree 1,123 directories before this pass and 1,129 after, 1,266 entries before and 1,272 after, 1,534 Markdown files under hermes/m